Hello world

To install requiremnets:
pip install -r .\requirements.txt

To run rule based agent:
py .\Rulebased.py

.\battlesnake\battlesnake.exe play -W 11 -H 11 --name 'Python Starter Project' --url http://localhost:8000 -g solo --browser


To run DQN agent:
When in folder type the following
python dqn_battlesnake.py --model results/dqn_seed0_steps20000/dqn.zip --port 8006